{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45146","headline":"奉送陆中丞长源诏徵入朝 · 皎然","name":"奉送陆中丞长源诏徵入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏下酇侯幕，徵贤宠上勳。\n才当持汉典，道可至尧君。\n藩牧今荣饯，诗流此盛文。\n水从吴渚别，树向楚门分。\n宿寺期嘉月，看山识故云。\n归心复何奈，怊怅在江濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}